{"id":"wb-6-766","name":"平措林寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"甘丹彭措林寺","text":"甘丹彭措林寺（藏语称“甘丹彭措林”），简称“彭措林寺”（藏语称“彭措林”），又译“平措林寺”，位于中国西藏自治区日喀则市拉孜县彭措林乡，原是一座藏传佛教觉囊派寺院，后来改宗格鲁派。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%94%98%E4%B8%B9%E5%BD%AD%E6%8E%AA%E6%9E%97%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94996665,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94996665","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}